OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLow cloud
OL,6,Fand hill fog across the north of the
OL,7,Fregion, thick enough to bring some
OL,8,Flight rain and drizzle mostly on
OL,9,Fhigher ground. Drier in the south.
OL,10,FMild for the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLow cloud in the north slowly
OL,13,Flifts through the day but some spot of
OL,14,Frain will remain. Possible brighter
OL,15,Fspells in the south later. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarm for September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
