OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning much wetter on Wednesday with
OL,7,Fsome heavy rain. But drier once again
OL,8,Fon Thursday. Another band of rain
OL,9,Fmoves into the northwest into Friday.
OL,10,FTemperatures return to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
